title: "Active Dual-Wavelength Spectrophotometric & Thermographic Plant Stress Phenotyping System"
abstract: "An integrated hardware-software complex for active strobed dual-wavelength (660 nm / 850 nm) spectrophotometry and thermal imaging (UNI-T UTi120S) designed for non-invasive, early pre-visual diagnosis of water and osmotic stress in plants."
